*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/REPORT.md
# Deliberately-retained verification evidence, not a routine run artefact.
# REPORT.md records WHAT a run concluded; this records HOW that conclusion was
# shown to be non-vacuous. Raw zap-run.log stays ignored (65KB of scanner
# boilerplate); only the distilled assertion transcript is kept.
!*/IDOR-INVERSION-EVIDENCE.md
# Same purpose, different method. The inversion trick reads real status codes out
# of ZAP's mismatch warnings; this reads them by firing every control and probe
# directly against the running lane, which also works BEFORE ZAP and so catches a
# bad fixture in seconds rather than fifteen minutes. Kept for the same reason:
# a coverage claim whose only evidence is the absence of a failure line is the
# exact shape of assurance this tool exists to reject.
!*/IDOR-COVERAGE-EVIDENCE.md
